 "text": "Hey, how are you doing? It depends how much time you want spend together and how much you want explore. A cafe is pretty low key, while a nice park can be really nice. The bed bugs came from inside the bag, not the frame. You can wash and dry the bag, or get rid of it. Stick to basics you know you both like, like sandwiches and pastries. Stick together when you order, so one of you can try something bold If it' only a light shower, keep an umbrella in the car and go inside a cafe for ten minutes. If it stops, stay outside and enjoy each other's company.",
